> **Proven:** passes against our component. Mutation-caught — removing `(?!\/)` (the exact bypass `e9c2180` closed) **fails**; allowing `javascript:` **fails**. Control confirms safe hrefs still render `<a>`. No imports needed — ours already has `Box`, `expect`, `within`.

